I am back at my bicycle.
My two shopping bags are full now.
My bicycle has a basket.
I pack my things carefully into the basket.
The five apples and the cheese lie at the bottom.
Then come the four Brötchen.
I lay the flowers right at the top.
That way the flowers stay beautiful.
Everything has space in the basket.
I take my key.
I unlock the bicycle.
The market is very full now.
Many people are shopping here.
I get onto my bicycle.
I set off.
The way to my flat is not far.
I am very hungry.
At home I will immediately eat a Brötchen with cheese.
